    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Dr Zafar Fatmi has co-authored a new paper published in the  Lancet Planetary Health , highlighting the urgent need to eliminate lead from the global economy. The study, led by Stanford University and co-authored by experts from renowned institutions including AKU, Johns Hopkins Bloomberg School of Public Health, University of Southern California, and the Centre Scientifique de Monaco, presents compelling evidence for a swift global phaseout of lead.",
